    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/food-truck-lite/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Food Truck Lite is a modern and responsive theme crafted for food enthusiasts, street food vendors, gourmet food trucks, mobile kitchen operators, outdoor caterers, and event catering services aiming to build a strong digital presence. It’s ideal for showcasing menus, culinary events, outdoor dining experiences, and unique mobile kitchen setups using high-quality visuals and engaging layouts. The theme offers a user-friendly interface, customizable sections, responsive sliders, and booking or contact forms to help users reserve your food truck or catering services with ease. Built on lightweight, SEO-friendly HTML code, Food Truck Lite ensures fast loading speed, mobile responsiveness, and improved search performance. Social media integration boosts engagement, while plugin compatibility with WooCommerce for online food sales, Contact Form 7 for customer inquiries or bookings, WPML for multilingual sites, and Yoast SEO for better rankings makes it a complete website solution. This free theme is perfect for creating a professional, mobile-ready, and search-optimized website that highlights your culinary brand and helps attract more customers. View : https://preview.themesglance.com/food-truck-pro/"
    },
